    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93cfc9e136f2cc97bbbb048f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一边与气槽互相鞠躬，一边下定决心。\n不再是以粉丝的心态，而是从现在起作为支持她的立场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bf0afb288c1127de4ab17140c350b4834c125d4b2e85b2d84e3eca15795e158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145004.json",
      "json_path": [
