        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25776c78e45b26db9c71683d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了统治地位辉煌的竞赛生涯，一起努力吧。\n——总而言之最重要的是，照顾好她的精神状态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e11faa1ff12a10f16ba9181159f9b8fee3f590f4872208a70354efddb7ff75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
